    "1. Click \"Open Settings\" above — it opens System Settings → Privacy & Security": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 上の「システム設定を開く」を押すと、「プライバシーとセキュリティ」が開きます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "15 minutes before a calendar event.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カレンダーの予定の15分前に。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Find mull in the list and turn its switch on": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 一覧から mull を見つけてスイッチを入れる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. If mull isn't listed, click \"+\", then choose mull in Applications": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. mull が一覧に無ければ「＋」を押し、アプリケーションから mull を選ぶ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
