    },
    "A scheduled pull is already running — nothing new was started.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定期取得がすでに実行中のため、新しくは始めていません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A timestamped copy of the current file is saved beside it first, as %@ — the %lld most recent are kept and older ones are deleted. You can undo this at any time with Disconnect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先に現在のファイルの控えを %@ として隣に保存します。新しいものから%lld件を残し、それより古い控えは削除します。「接続を解除」でいつでも元に戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A timestamped copy of the current file is saved beside it first, as %@. You can undo this at any time with Disconnect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
