      }
    },
    "Everything mull writes, and mull's own windows. The files in ~/mull change on the next write; the windows change when mull next opens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mull が書くものすべてと、mull 自身の画面。~/mull のファイルは次の書き込みで、画面は次に mull を開いたときに切り替わります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything older than %@ will be permanently removed from your recordings. Summaries and the markdown files in ~/mull are kept. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@より古いものが記録から完全に削除されます。要約と ~/mull のマークダウンは残ります。これは取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you told mull at setup — your role, working language, what you're building, how you want AI to answer — is removed from me.pinned.md. Anything you wrote in that file by hand is kept. mull will go back to inferring these from what you do.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "セットアップで mull に伝えた内容（役割・作業言語・作っているもの・AI にどう答えてほしいか）を me.pinned.md から削除します。あなたが自分で書いた行はそのまま残ります。以後 mull は、あなたの作業からこれらを推測し直します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
