    },
    "Shows the exact change first, then writes mull into %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更内容をそのまま先に見せてから、%@ に mull を書き込みます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the exact change first, then writes mull into %@, creating it if needed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更内容をそのまま先に見せてから、%@ に mull を書き込みます。無ければ作成します"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Skip": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スキップ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So far": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここまで"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So you never have to paste it. mull can add itself to the AI tools already on this Mac — you'll see the exact change before anything is written.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "貼り付ける手間を無くすためです。mull は、この Mac にある AI ツールへ自分を登録できます。書き込む前に、変更内容をそのまま確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some of the record may be missing": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録の一部が欠けている可能性があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something else — the MCP server, Obsidian, Finder — rewrote this file while you were editing it. Both versions still exist. Whichever one you set aside is kept as a file next to this one; mull throws neither of them away.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "編集中に、ほかの何か（MCP サーバー・Obsidian・Finder など）がこのファイルを書き換えました。両方の版が残っています。採らなかったほうは隣のファイルとして保存されます。mull はどちらも捨てません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start Recording": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録を開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting soon": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まもなく開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays on this Mac — %@ runs locally.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac から出ません。%@ はローカルで動きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stays on this Mac. No provider is on, so nothing is uploaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Mac から出ません。プロバイダが無効なので、何も送信されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still stuck? Open Settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "うまくいきませんか？ 設定を開く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop excluding %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ の除外をやめる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop generating": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成を止める"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop generating (⌘.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成を止める（⌘.）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped before it finished.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終わる前に止めました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped — mull is not capturing anything": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止中: mull は何も記録していません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Storage": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ストレージ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in macOS Keychain": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS のキーチェーンに保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored records — keystroke buffers, clipboard entries, window and app changes. Not a measure of what you did.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みレコード（打鍵バッファ・クリップボード・ウィンドウとアプリの切り替え）。仕事量の指標ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Style copied from: ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文体の参照元: "
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Subject and sender only; this channel never reads the body. The text on screen while you're reading mail is captured like any other app's, unless you add Mail below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "件名と送信者だけで、この経路は本文を読みません。メールを読んでいる間に画面に出ている文字は、下で Mail を足さないかぎり、他のアプリと同じように捕捉されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summarize what I did today.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日やったことをまとめて。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summary notifications": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要約の通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "THIS WEEK": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今週"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TIMELINE": {
