          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TODAY'S REPORT": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日のレポート"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the version on disk": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ディスク上の版を採用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell mull the essentials": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要点を mull に伝える"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test connection": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接続を試す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test mull's MCP server": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "MCP サーバーを試す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That didn't finish": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完了しませんでした"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That one needs a model to read your records. Ollama and LM Studio ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "それには、記録を読むためのモデルが要ります。Ollama と LM Studio は"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's the whole of it, and it stays on this Mac. Nothing is sent anywhere until you send it, and you can pause or delete any of it whenever you like.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上がすべてで、どれもこの Mac に留まります。あなたが送るまで何も送信されませんし、いつでも停止も削除もできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The AI can draft it from what you did today.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日あなたがしたことから、AI が下書きを起こせます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The banner when the nightly summary finishes or fails. A run you start yourself is silent. The summary itself still appears in the window and the menu bar's unread mark.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夜の要約が終わったとき、または失敗したときのバナーです。自分で走らせた分は出ません。要約そのものはウィンドウとメニューバーの未読マークに出ます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edits you just made to your answers won't be saved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いま回答に加えた編集は保存されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The files for your AI are not being written": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 向けのファイルが書かれていません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The note leaves mull's memory and its file is removed from ~/mull/memory. Your recorded events are untouched.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このメモは mull の記憶から外れ、ファイルも ~/mull/memory から削除されます。記録したイベントには触れません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recordings could not be deleted: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録を削除できませんでした: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recordings database could not be cleared: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録のデータベースを消去できませんでした: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript is not saved anywhere — clearing it cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "会話の履歴はどこにも保存されていません。消去すると元に戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The version that was on disk is safe in %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ディスク上にあった版は %@ に保存してあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words you have written since you opened the editor will be removed. Tomorrow's draft would have copied its style from this text, and it cannot be recovered.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エディタを開いてから書いた文章が削除されます。明日の下書きがこの文章の文体を引き継ぐはずでしたが、取り戻せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The written summary is generated overnight, once a full day has passed and about %lld records have been kept.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文章の要約は夜のうちに作られます。丸1日が過ぎ、記録が%lld件ほど溜まってからです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ~/mull folder could not be removed: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "~/mull フォルダを削除できませんでした: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's nothing to hand over yet — mull has only just started. Come back after some work and your day will be in here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "まだ渡せるものがありません。mull は始まったばかりです。しばらく作業してから戻ってくると、その日の内容がここに入ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These lines are placed above everything mull works out on its own. Use them for what it gets wrong, or could not know. Saved as you type, to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここに書いた行は、mull が自分で導いたすべてより上に置かれます。間違っていること、mull には知りようのないことを書いてください。入力するそばから %@ に保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This calendar is subscribed, so mull can only read it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このカレンダーは購読しているものなので、mull は読むことしかできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This day has more matches than the timeline lists": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この日には、タイムラインに出ている以上の一致があります"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file changed outside mull. Choose which version to keep — the other one is set aside, not lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このファイルは mull の外で変更されました。どちらの版を残すか選んでください。採らなかったほうは失われず、別ファイルとして保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is what you'd hand an AI": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これが AI に渡すもの"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This page is written after a full day of work. That day hasn't happened yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このページは1日ぶん作業したあとに書かれます。まだその1日がありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes %1$@ recorded events, %2$@ daily summaries, %3$@ memories, and every markdown file in ~/mull — me.md, now.md, and all your notes, projects and reports. Nothing goes to the Trash. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "記録したイベント%1$@件、日々の要約%2$@件、メモリ%3$@件、そして ~/mull のすべてのマークダウン（me.md・now.md・ノート・プロジェクト・レポートのすべて）を完全に削除します。ゴミ箱には入りません。これは取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This provider sends your activity data off-device to process it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このプロバイダは、処理のためにあなたの活動データを Mac の外へ送ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time range": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "期間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timed out — server not responding": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "タイムアウトしました。サーバーが応答していません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today (⌘T)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日（⌘T）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's last meeting has ended": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日の最後の予定は終わりました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's report in ~/mull is the version you kept. The AI will write a new draft and put it in that place. Your kept copy is saved beside it, not deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "~/mull にある今日のレポートは、あなたが保存した版です。AI が新しい下書きを書き、その場所に入ります。保存済みの版は削除されず、隣に保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Today's summary": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日の要約"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow's draft copies its style from your edit.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
