    "macOS refused: %@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS に拒否されました: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask whether mull may control Mail. This reads the subject and sender of mail received in the last 24 hours, not the body, and keeps them on this Mac. It does not change what mull reads from your screen: while you are reading mail, the text in the window is captured like any other app's. To stop that too, add Mail under \"Don't record in these apps\" below.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mull が Mail を操作してよいか、macOS が尋ねます。この経路が読むのは直近24時間に届いたメールの件名と送信者だけで、本文は読まず、この Mac の中に留めます。画面から読む分は変わりません。メールを読んでいる間、そのウィンドウの文字は他のアプリと同じように捕捉されます。それも止めるには、下の「Don't record in these apps」に Mail を足してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mull": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "mull cannot write to the ~/mull folder, so me.md, now.md and full.md have stopped being refreshed. Recording itself is unaffected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "mull が ~/mull フォルダに書き込めないため、me.md・now.md・full.md の更新が止まっています。記録そのものには影響ありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "mull could not write to ~/mull.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
